  "_comment": "What 'ready for a beginner' means for Dari. Same categories as the Catalan spec, different members - the structure is shared because the pedagogy is, the words are not. Kabul standard throughout: چوکی not صندلی, بوت not کفش, کچالو not سیب‌زمینی, مکتب not مدرسه. Dari's frequency ranking is anchored to hand-curated Dari order rather than a corpus, so it does not have Catalan's abstract-head problem; what it has instead are absences, and this file is what makes them countable.",
